# Phyntom X8 Console — production (Amplify static + api.mega-x.ai backend)
#
# Frontend stays on Amplify (git push auto-deploy). API / WebSocket hit the
# EC2 FastAPI via https://api.mega-x.ai (Caddy → :8001).
VITE_USE_MOCK=false
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.mega-x.ai

# 游戏部「聊天」内嵌的游戏前端（rel：A 上 docker-compose-game-rel.yaml，nginx TLS 终结）。
# 游戏侧 VITE_EMBED_PARENT_ORIGINS 要包含 https://mega-x.ai，免登凭证才会被接收。
VITE_GAME_URL=https://game.mega-x.ai
